msgctxt "604W021"
msgid "Oh, that's too big to lug around."
msgstr "Åh, den är för stor att släpa runt på."

msgctxt "604W022"
msgid "That tube goes down to the middle level of the cage."
msgstr "Det där röret leder ned till burens mellannivå."

msgctxt "604W024"
msgid "That tube goes down to the other levels of the cage."
msgstr "Det där röret leder ned till burens andra nivåer."

msgctxt "604W025"
msgid "I'm not getting out that way."
msgstr "Jag tar mig inte ut den vägen."

msgctxt "604W026"
msgid "Ugh! Dirty!"
msgstr "Usch! Smutsigt!"

msgctxt "604W027"
msgid "I don't want to hurt my gerbils."
msgstr "Jag vill inte skada mina ökenråttor."

msgctxt "604W028"
msgid "Eat photons, you mutated robo-rodents!"
msgstr "Ät fotoner, era muterade robotgnagare!"

msgctxt "604W029"
msgid "Nah, that would probably make it smell even worse."
msgstr "Nä, det skulle förmodligen få det att lukta ännu värre."

msgctxt "604Z002"
msgid "HAHAHAHAHAHA"
msgstr "HAHAHAHAHAHA"

msgctxt "604Z003"
msgid "Did I scare you?"
msgstr "Skrämde jag dig?"

msgctxt "604Z004A"
msgid ""
"Good! Now listen up. Intelligence is defined as the capacity to adapt, "
"survive and flourish."
msgstr ""
"Bra! Lyssna nu. Intelligens definieras som förmågan att anpassa sig, "
"överleva och blomstra."

msgctxt "604Z004B"
msgid "This is where we test the SURVIVE part of the definition."
msgstr "Här testar vi delen ÖVERLEVA i definitionen."

msgctxt "604Z004C"
msgid ""
"To pass, all you have to do is find your way out of the cage. Dad, dad."
msgstr "För att klara testet behöver du bara hitta ut ur buren. Dad, dad."

msgctxt "604Z005"
msgid "You will see about that."
msgstr "Det får vi se."

msgctxt "604Z006"
msgid "Flemix, issue him a weapon!"
msgstr "Flemix, ge honom ett vapen!"

msgctxt "604Z007"
msgid "So many questions for such a little man. Yeah, yeah, yeah."
msgstr "Så många frågor från en sådan liten människa. Ja, ja, ja."

msgctxt "605W001"
msgid "You guys can talk? Oh no! No, no, no! WAAAH!"
msgstr "Kan ni prata? Åh nej! Nej, nej, nej! WAAAH!"

msgctxt "605W002E"
msgid "Oh no! No, no, no! Don't shoot!"
msgstr "Åh nej! Nej, nej, nej! Skjut inte!"

msgctxt "605X001"
msgid "Locked on Lifesign... FIREWING!"
msgstr "Låst på livstecken … FIREWING!"

msgctxt "606W003B"
msgid "Nooooooo!"
msgstr "Neeeeej!"

msgctxt "606W003D"
msgid "Ah! Let me outta here!"
msgstr "Ah! Släpp ut mig härifrån!"

msgctxt "606X001"
msgid "I thought I'd find... FIRE FIRE FIRE FIRE!"
msgstr "Jag trodde att jag skulle hitta … ELD ELD ELD ELD!"

msgctxt "608F001"
msgid ""
"If that was the suicide test, you would have passed with flying colors."
msgstr "Om det där var självmordstestet hade du klarat det med glans."

msgctxt "608F002A"
msgid "Back to earth with you, buddy!"
msgstr "Tillbaka till jorden med dig, kompis!"

msgctxt "608F003A"
msgid ""
"I don't know what you did in there, but you sure made a mess of things."
msgstr ""
"Jag vet inte vad du gjorde där inne, men du gjorde verkligen en röra av "
"allting."

msgctxt "608F004A"
msgid ""
"Survival instincts. Ha! Sometimes I think these creatures actually want to "
"be burger meat."
msgstr ""
"Överlevnadsinstinkter. Ha! Ibland tror jag att de här varelserna faktiskt "
"vill bli hamburgerkött."

msgctxt "609W001"
msgid "Holy smokes! They're blasting each other to kingdom come!"
msgstr "Herregud! De spränger varandra åt helvete!"

msgctxt "609W002A"
msgid "Not a pretty sight."
msgstr "Ingen vacker syn."

msgctxt "609W002B"
msgid "Yeesh!"
msgstr "Usch!"

msgctxt "610F001"
msgid "Oh, sorry boss, it's just that the human specimen passed."
msgstr ""
"Åh, förlåt chef, men det är bara det att det mänskliga exemplaret klarade "
"testet."

msgctxt "610F002"
msgid "Oh, no, no. He didn't pass away. He passed the survival test."
msgstr "Åh, nej, nej. Han dog inte. Han klarade överlevnadstestet."

msgctxt "610F003"
msgid "Well, he seems to be a rather bright one."
msgstr "Nåja, han verkar vara ganska smart."

msgctxt "610Z001"
msgid "Aham, aham, aham, aham, aham..."
msgstr "Aham, aham, aham, aham, aham …"

msgctxt "610Z002"
msgid ""
"Ah, eyeballs are red, eyeballs are blue. No matter what color, they're "
"delicious to chew."
msgstr "Ah, ögon är röda, ögon är blå. Oavsett färg är de goda att tugga på."

msgctxt "610Z003"
msgid "MMM MMM MMM MMM MMM"
msgstr "MMM MMM MMM MMM MMM"

msgctxt "610Z004"
msgid "**coughing**"
msgstr "**hostar**"

msgctxt "610Z005"
msgid "What is it? You know I hate being disturbed during brunch!"
msgstr "Vad är det? Du vet att jag hatar att bli störd under brunchen!"

msgctxt "610Z006"
msgid "AWAY!"
msgstr "BORT!"

msgctxt "610Z007"
msgid ""
"Hidden what? That's impossible! That pathetic human doesn't have the brains "
"to pass!"
msgstr ""
"Gömda vad? Det är omöjligt! Den där patetiska människan har inte "
"hjärnkapacitet nog att klara testet!"

msgctxt "610Z008"
msgid "Nonsense! Trauma back in a brig!"
msgstr "Nonsens! Släng tillbaka honom i arresten!"

msgctxt "610Z009"
msgid "I'll see to it that the next test is his last."
msgstr "Jag ska se till att nästa test blir hans sista."

msgctxt "612W043"
msgid "Ooh, what a grizzly sight!"
msgstr "Åh, vilken gräslig syn!"

msgctxt "612W044"
msgid "I can't reach it, and I don't want to reach it!"
msgstr "Jag kan inte nå den och jag vill inte nå den!"

msgctxt "612W045"
msgid "The resemblance to Winona is just uncanny."
msgstr "Likheten med Winona är kuslig."

msgctxt "612W046"
msgid "I can't take that. And I don't want to take that!"
msgstr "Jag kan inte ta den. Och jag vill inte ta den!"

msgctxt "612W047"
msgid "Ooh, yuck! Can't use that!"
msgstr "Åh, usch! Jag kan inte använda det där!"

msgctxt "612W048"
msgid "Carnage!"
msgstr "Blodbad!"

msgctxt "612W049"
msgid "More carnage!"
msgstr "Mer blodbad!"

msgctxt "612W050"
msgid "Twisted metal and fur? I don't think so."
msgstr "Vridet metallskrot och päls? Det tror jag inte."

msgctxt "612W051"
msgid "It's still going!"
msgstr "Den fortsätter fortfarande!"
